WEBVTT

00:00:27.897 --> 00:00:30.863
take it home,
put it on the wall, enjoy it,

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:32.697
show it to your friends;

00:00:32.697 --> 00:00:34.230
it might even be an investment.

00:00:35.397 --> 00:00:40.297
The artwork becomes part of your story
and adds meaning to your life.

00:00:40.297 --> 00:00:42.463
It marks a time and a feeling for you.

00:00:43.063 --> 00:00:45.763
Now, we can have the exact same experience

00:00:45.797 --> 00:00:48.063
in virtual galleries, with digital art.

00:00:48.463 --> 00:00:52.330
While this might seem
like an obscure niche on the internet,

00:00:52.363 --> 00:00:55.997
let's take a look at a recent auction sale
that you might have heard of.

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:58.163
In March of 2021,

00:00:58.197 --> 00:01:00.263
the major auction house Christie's